{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫電視（TVB）年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》今晚（19日）舉行，每年台慶都會有豐富獎金、獎品作抽獎，今年甫開首經已送出兩份獎品連免找數簽賬總值8萬3千元，結果羅嘉良抽中黃庭鋒，汪明荃則抽中劉頌鵬，而黃庭鋒被抽中時，一度找不到他，幸最終都趕得</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:57:35.283296+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:20:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:50:50.707163+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:50:50.707163+00:00","content_hash":"5b71628381633945ac3896ca75108a83b2a42cd67911f80c206a3744027bc885","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}